{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is in reach, pick it up, check properties, do specific task, move to location or scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = FindAndApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInReach    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    />",
